IceCache/source/icecache_cpp.*
# experiment/ holds both reports and bulk run data. Track the reports (the design
# spec and the early experiment notes are cited by code comments in page_scan.py and
# infer_state.py, so a fresh clone needs them); keep the data out.
# NOTE: this must be `experiment/*` and not `experiment/` -- excluding the
# directory itself makes every negation below a no-op.
experiment/*
!experiment/*.md
!experiment/*.py
!experiment/*.sh
__pycache__/
IceCache/benchmark/passkey.jsonl
IceCache/benchmark/pred/
*.bak_*
IceCache/benchmark/agent_cache/
IceCache/source/build/
IceCache/source/icecache/_mdci_batch.cpython-310-x86_64-linux-gnu.so
code_ref/
PAG/
.claude/
